  https://www.progresstoronto.ca/election-training-series-sep-19-2026\n\nHo
 sted by Progress Toronto (https://www.progresstoronto.ca/)\n\nDoor
  knocking (also known as canvassing) is a crucial part of a winning
  strategy for progressive campaigns. Face-to-face conversations are a
