 d by Toronto Public Library (https://www.torontopubliclibrary.ca)\n\nJoin
  Dr. Ruth Green for a discussion that explores the line between Indigenous
  cultural appreciation and cultural appropriation. Using real world
  examples like artwork\, jewelry\, clothing\, and pow wows\, Ruth will
